{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>For I will pour, etc.</b> Just as I pour water on a thirsty place, so will I pour the spirit of my holiness, or the spirit of my salvation. The tsadi in אצק has a dagesh because of the missing yod; similarly, בטרם אצרך בבטן (Jeremiah 1:5)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 44, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:57:51.229003533Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}